  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia - Weather and Climate Science for Service Partnership S E Asia (WCSSP) - Calls - tender</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme to help improve modelling capability of high impact weather in the region, enabling mitigation of risk from extreme weather events</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened partnership between meteorological services in UK, Philippines, Malaysia and Indonesia to produce scoping study identifying Indonesia/ S-E Asian region weather forecasting and climate research priorities.  This includes training needs analysis for future capacity building work and initial survey of severe weather and DRR services.</narrative>
  </description>
